Substance-abuse support is also part of the clinic''s offering, addressing a need that comes up often in communities like Imizamo Yethu alongside the more routine health services on offer. Based on Hout Bay Main Road, the clinic keeps extended weekday hours, open from 8am to 9pm Monday to Friday to make it easier for working residents to get to.', source_urls = json_insert(CASE WHEN json_valid(source_urls) AND json_type(source_urls) = 'array' THEN source_urls ELSE '[]' END, '$[#]', 'https://www.capetown.gov.za/local%20and%20communities/see-all-city-facilities/our-service-facilities/Clinics%20and%20healthcare%20facilities/hout-bay-main-road-clinic', '$[#]', 'https://d7.westerncape.gov.za/facility/hout-bay-main-road-clinic'), description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'hout-bay-main-road-clinic-imizamo-yethu' AND description = 'Hout Bay Main Road Clinic is a public healthcare facility in Imizamo Yethu run by the City of Cape Town, providing general health, HIV/TB and substance-abuse support services to the local community.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
