This branch trades from the Langa Junction shopping centre on Brinton Street, putting it within easy reach of shoppers and commuters passing through one of Langa''s main retail points. Based in Langa, Cape Town, the outlet is open Monday to Friday from 8am to 6pm, Saturdays until 3pm and Sundays until 4pm, covering a full day of trade without staying open into the evening.', source_urls = json_insert(CASE WHEN json_valid(source_urls) AND json_type(source_urls) = 'array' THEN source_urls ELSE '[]' END, '$[#]', 'https://hungrylionmenu.co.za/locations/hungry-lion-langa-mallshop-7-langa-junctionbrinton-streetlangacape-town7456/', '$[#]', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hungry_Lion'), description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'hungry-lion-langa-junction-langa' AND description = 'Hungry Lion Langa Junction is a branch of Hungry Lion, the South African fast-food chain known for its fried chicken, founded in 1997 and now operating across the country; this outlet trades from Langa Junction shopping centre in Langa.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
